{
  "ProgressBar shows how far an operation has progressed, as a line or a circle, or indicates activity when the progress is unknown. Spinner shows that the system is busy. It is a rotating ring that can stand alone or cover a panel while it loads, and it can wait for a delay so that quick operations do not cause a flash.": "",
  "Every prop accepts a value or a function, and a function that reads a reactive object keeps the bar in sync with the operation. When you create the component with `new`, set the same properties programmatically.": "",
  "Indeterminate progress": "",
  "Without a value (`null`), the bar shows continuous motion. Set a number once the operation can report its progress.": "",
  "Linear and circular": "",
  "`shape=\"circle\"` draws the progress as an arc that runs around a ring from the top, and without a value the arc rotates. The label can appear below it (`labelPosition=\"bottom\"`, the default), above it or next to it, and `size` sets the size of the circle and its stroke. Where the design language includes a wave (Material), the line and arc animate as they grow, and they stay straight at the very beginning and end.": "",
  "Sizes, side labels and custom text": "",
  "`size` sets the thickness. `labelPosition=\"side\"` places the label before the bar and the value after it. `valueText` provides a custom value format.": "",
  "Spinner": "Spinner",
  "A spinner with `delay` stays hidden for that long after it is created or shown again. Quick operations show nothing, and slow ones show the spinner.": "",
  "Covering a panel while it loads": "",
  "`Spinner.cover(target)` places a spinner over a component or element and returns a function that removes it. The content underneath cannot be clicked or focused. If focus was inside, it moves to the spinner and returns afterward.": "",
  "`role=\"progressbar\"` with `aria-valuenow`, `aria-valuemin`, `aria-valuemax` and `aria-valuetext` (the percentage or `valueText`). None of these are set while the progress is unknown.": "",
  "`role=\"progressbar\"` without a value, which indicates unknown progress. It is not a `status` live region, because those interrupt the screen reader each time one appears, and a page with several would be noisy.": "",
  "Named by the label (`aria-labelledby`), or by `uiLocale.strings.loading` if there is none.": "",
  "The container gets `aria-busy=\"true\"`, and the content under the spinner is `inert`. Focus inside it moves to the spinner and returns when the spinner is removed.": "",
  "With reduced motion, the bar rests as a tinted track, new values appear immediately, the wave stops, and the arcs, ring and shape are static. A wave is drawn only while the bar is visible.": "",
  "A bar or spinner without a label is named `uiLocale.strings.loading`. The percentage uses `locale`, which defaults to the page `lang`.": "",
  "The bar. `data-state=\"determinate | indeterminate\"`, `data-complete`, `data-shape`, `data-wave` (a wave is drawn), `data-tone`, `data-size`, `data-label-position`, `data-stretch`, and `--_fraction` for the completed share from 0 to 1.": "",
  "The label row.": "",
  "The line: the track (`::before` for the remainder and `::after` for the stop dot) and the completed part (`::after` for the indeterminate runner).": "",
  "The wave drawn over the track in place of the bar.": "",
  "The circle: its drawing, the ring and the arc.": "Daire: çizimi, halka ve yay.",
  "The spinner. `data-size`, `data-tone`, `data-label-position`, `data-contained`, `data-waiting`, `data-cover`.": "Spinner. `data-size`, `data-tone`, `data-label-position`, `data-contained`, `data-waiting`, `data-cover`.",
  "The container of the rotating part.": "",
  "The ring, the shape (the design language shows one of them) and the label.": "",
  "A container under `Spinner.cover`.": "`Spinner.cover` altındaki kapsayıcı.",
  "Units of the line, each with its box: the band, the completed part, the remainder of the track, the stop dot, the runner and the wave color. States: `indeterminate`, `complete` and the tones.": "",
  "Units of the circle and the label.": "",
  "The line per size, the gap after the completed part, and the dot.": "",
  "The wave: its amplitude (0 for none), wavelength, speed and direction, the progress range where it animates, and how long it takes to appear.": "",
  "The circle per size, its gaps, its rotating arc and its wave.": "",
  "The width when not stretched, the label and the tones.": "",
  "The ring and the shape, per size.": "",
  "Units: the container (`contained`), the ring and the shape, each with its box.": "Unit'ler: kapsayıcı (`contained`), halka ve şekil, her biri kutusuyla.",
  "The sequence of shapes (names from the kit shapes), the cycle duration, the transition to each shape, and one rotation.": "",
  "The space between the ring and the label.": "",
  "The layer over a covered container.": "Örtülen kapsayıcının üzerindeki katman.",
  "ProgressBar props": "ProgressBar prop'ları",
  "The progress. Use `null` or omit it when the progress is unknown: the bar shows continuous motion and a circle rotates.": "",
  "The limits of `value`.": "",
  "A label that names the bar. This is the same property as `text`.": "",
  "`line` shows a bar along a track, and `circle` shows an arc around a ring from the top.": "",
  "`'top'` (`'bottom'` for a circle)": "`'top'` (daire için `'bottom'`)",
  "`top` places the label and value above the bar, `bottom` places them below it, and `side` places the label before it and the value after it.": "",
  "Shows the percentage, rounded down to a whole number, or `valueText`.": "",
  "The text shown and announced for a value (`3 of 12 files`). Because it is a function, it is stored as is and not bound.": "",
  "The locale of the percentage.": "",
  "The thickness, and the size of a circle: `sm`, `md` or `lg`.": "",
  "Spinner props": "Spinner prop'ları",
  "Text next to the ring. This is the same property as `text`.": "",
  "Places the label after the ring or below it.": "",
  "The color of the rotating part.": "",
  "Places the spinner in its own container (a disc behind it), where the design language includes one.": "",
  "The delay in milliseconds before it appears, counted from when it is created or shown again. Quick operations then show nothing.": "",
  "Showing it again with `visible` restarts the delay.": "",
  "Properties and methods": "Property'ler ve method'lar",
  "Access / return value": "",
  "The completed share from 0 to 1, or `null` while the progress is unknown.": "",
  "Indicates that it is still within its delay.": "",
  "Covers a component or element with a spinner. Call the returned function to remove it. See Covering a panel.": ""
}
